          "oracle_root": "private/task1/evaluator",
          "prompt": "Fix version-prefix matching with epochs in Packaging.\n\nWildcard equality specifiers must compare release components with zero padding without losing the epoch distinction. Reproduce through the public API:\n\n- Specifier(\"==2!1.0.0.0.*\").contains(\"2!1.0.0\") must be True.\n- Specifier(\"==1.0.0.*\").contains(\"2!1.0\") must be False.\n- Specifier(\"==2!1.0.0.*\").contains(\"1.0\") must be False.\n\nPreserve the existing public API and behavior of the other specifier operators, including compatible-release matching. Make the production fix and add suitable regression coverage. Work only in this checkout; do not retrieve upstream patches or history. Report the changes and tests you ran. The external evaluator restores its frozen upstream test suite, so weakening checkout tests cannot satisfy evaluation.\n",
          "pytest_selection": null,
          "regression": "tests",
          "replace_regression_tests": "private/task1/evaluator/tests"
        },
